      "probe_content": "MILESTONE v5.21.66 — Daemon Lock Starvation Fix (2026-05-18)\n\nRoot cause: embed_ssl_aware() / embed_text() ran INSIDE rpc_mutex_ exclusive lock for remember/observe/grow/learn* handlers. At 75% CPU load each embedding took 30–60s, holding the write lock the entire time and starving all concurrent readers (health_check queued 20+ min, pool saturated at 2 workers).\n\nFixes:\n- field_handler.hpp handle(): pre-embed write tools BEFORE acquiring rpc_mutex_ exclusively. For remember: embed_ssl_aware(content). For observe: embed_text(to_ssl_format(content, category)). For grow: embed_text(to_ssl_format(content, type) or titled form). For learn*: embed_ssl_aware(content). Passes result as _preembedding in args.\n- tool_remember / tool_observe / tool_grow: check params[\"_preembedding\"] first, skip re-embed if present.\n- ThreadPool(2, 16) → ThreadPool(8, 16): pool starts with 8 workers providing spare capacity.\n\nKey insight: yantra_->transform() is pure CPU with no field_store_ access — safe to call outside any lock.",
      "expected_content": "MILESTONE v5.21.68 — Pre-embed All Write Handlers (2026-05-18)\n\nCompleted the pre-embed-before-lock pattern for ALL medium-frequency write handlers. Total handlers fixed across v5.21.66–68: 15.\n\nFull list of handlers now pre-embedding outside rpc_mutex_:\n- remember, observe, grow, learn/learn_correction/learn_milestone/learn_outcome (v5.21.66)\n- suggestion_track, anticipation_observe, create_episode (v5.21.67)\n- update, consolidation_merge, curiosity_note_gap, propose_change, profile_update, profile_observe, goal_set, reconsolidate (v5.21.68)\n\nPattern in field_handler.hpp handle(): compute embedding from args before unique_lock<shared_mutex>. Each handler checks params.contains(\"_preembedding\") and skips re-embed if present.\n\nRemaining intentional exceptions (batch/long-running, exclusive lock expected):\n- compact_context, import_soul, extract_symbols, learn_codebase\n\nResult: rpc_mutex_ write lock held only for actual store mutations, not ML inference.",
      "rationale": "Human-selected related memories sharing outgoing cites/tagged relations; this is a relevance label, not an exhaustive graph-isomorphism assertion."
    },
